      152  ==Culture==
      153  The network of cultural institutions in the district includes 121 units, including 63 [[Palace of Culture|houses of culture]], 54 [[library|libraries]], a [[music school]], two [[art school]]s, and [[museum]]s.
      154  ==Health==
      155  The district has the Fălești [[Hospital]], medical points in all villages, and a state [[Pharmacy (shop)|pharmacy]] with 53 branches.
